      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "2.According to the petitioner, she is the defacto complainant in this case and based on her complaint, the FIR in Crime No.8 of 2009 has been registered for the offence under Sections 419,\n467, 468, 420 and 120(B) of IPC.",
