      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "5.Considering that the case is pending from the year 2009 and also taking note of the fact that for the past nine years, the case in C.C.No.55 of 2016 is pending without any progress in trial, the learned Judicial Magistrate No.I, Madurai, is directed to complete the trial proceedings in C.C.No.\n55 of 2016 as early as possible preferably within a period of six months, from the date of this order.\n6.With the above direction, this Criminal Original Petition is disposed of.\n \n Internet :Yes  Index :Yes/No  NCC :Yes/No  LR  To 1.",
